 $f(x,y),$ calculate $\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}$ given that $\frac{∂f}{∂y}={y}^{3}\operatorname{sin}⁡(1+3xy).$" :question/worked-solution "To find $\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative $\frac{∂f}{∂y}$ with respect to $y:$

